      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a new employee handbook for my company and we're debating whether or not to mandate gender-neutral pronouns in all internal comms. some managers think it's a huge part of being an inclusive workplace but others are worried it's just gonna be confusing for people and make some employees feel like they're being forced into an ideology. what's your take on this, like is it actually a good move for company culture or just unnecessary?",
